        {
          "text": "Arikw abo nkunda, iri rimwe mweho ntimuryiyobagize, yuko ku Mwami Imana umusi umwe umeze nk’imyaka igihumbi, n’imyaka igihumbi imeze nk’umusi umwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.8",
