        },
        {
          "text": "Arik’ umusi w’Umwami wacu uzoza nk’igisuma, ah’ amajuru azovaho, hakaba n’ukwasana guhambaye, ivy’ itanguriro vyose bigashongeshwa n’ikibengebenge gikaze, isi n’ibikorwa biri muri yo bigatongoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
