        {
          "text": "no mu kurereka ukuza kw’umusi w’Imana muwuhahamiye, uzotuma amajuru ashongeshwa no gusha, kand’ ivy’ itanguriro vyose bikayagishwa n’ikibengebenge gikaze? ",
