              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagenjeje artyo mu vyete vyiwe vyose, aho yavuze ivyo: muri vyo harimwo bimwe-bimwe bigoye itahura, ivy’ abatungu badakomeye bagoreka, nk’uko bagira ivyanditswe bindi, bakīhamagarira guhona. ",
          "type": "text",
